  "description_original": "Tivat – Long-Term Rental\nA 71 m² two-bedroom apartment with a garage parking space is available for long-term rent in an excellent location in Tivat.\nThe apartment offers sea views from every room, creating a unique atmosphere and a sense of everyday luxury.\nIt features underfloor heating and three Samsung Wind-Free multisplit air-conditioning units, ensuring year-round comfort.\nIdeally located close to Porto Montenegro, Tivat city center, and Tivat Airport, making it an excellent choice for long-term living.\nSpacious, bright, and functional, the apartment is ready for immediate move-in.\nFor more information or to arrange a viewing, please send a DM.\nFeatures: Sunny • New Build • Luxury • Quiet Area • Move-in Ready",
